# Immersive speaking transcript

When the assistant speaks, transcript text must:

- Always render on **exactly one line** (`maxLines = 1`)
- Reveal **word by word** as speech progresses (TTS spoken length / speech-paced reveal)
- Stay **centered**
- Stay within **60% of screen width** (`fillMaxWidth(0.6f)` on `ImmersiveTranscript`)
- Only lay out **revealed** words in `LiveInputText` — do not keep invisible tokens in layout (that pushes visible text far left)
- Remain visible (snap transcript alpha on for User and Assistant speakers)

Prefer changes in `com/assistant/ui` / `.../assistant/`, never allowlisted master agent `.kt`.
